      "deliberate": {
        "why": "Security hole in Ruby: ok_to_update? on a Bootswatch skin's +*colors is `left.parent? && super`, so for a skin without a parent the permission check never runs and anyone, anonymous visitors included, can change the site's colours. The port keeps checking the rules and refuses.",
